    "",
    "Signing in, then straight to your containers and the gui-vnc image.",
    "Creating a desktop as an admin, privileged mode ticked; it shows up in the list live.",
    "Console opens a root shell in the desktop over a WebSocket; exit closes it.",
    "The NoVNC desktop: VNC password, then VS Code, Firefox and htop in the browser.",
    "Same routes as the Django version, but the API is one Rust binary, queue worker included.",
    "What each click does, from login to desktop. Access tokens last one hour here."
